    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just \"emptiness\" though. i used to be someone. i had weight, i had impact. now i’m just a joke people whisper about. rebuilding feels like a joke... like how do you rebuild a life that’s fundamentally broken? you can't. you just patch the holes and pretend. it's exhausting to even pretend.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
